{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec", "label": "recipe-import Specification", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "Main OpenSpec spec for the recipe-import capability (created by archiving build-cooking-hub)"}, {"id": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "label": "Read a recipe from a page (recipe-import)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "`readRecipe(url)` SHALL fetch an `http`/`https` URL on the server (timeout 10 s, at most 5 MB read, redirects followed) and read the first schema.org `Recipe` from the page's JSON-LD, also inside `@graph` and in arrays, skipping scripts that are not valid JSON. It SHALL map `name`, `description`, `recipeYield` (first whole number \u2192 servings, else 2), `prepTime`/`cookTime` (ISO 8601 durations \u2192 min", "scenarios": ["Recipe is read from saved real pages", "Recipe found inside @graph", "HowToSection becomes step sections", "ISO 8601 durations become minutes", "recipeYield becomes servings", "Categories and keywords become tag names", "Relative image URL is resolved"]}, {"id": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_import_fallback", "label": "Import fallback (recipe-import)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "`readRecipe` SHALL return a fallback draft when the page is unreachable, answers with an error status, times out, is larger than the limit or holds no Recipe data: the source URL and, if the HTML could be read, the title from `og:title` (else `<title>`) and the image URL from `og:image`. A URL that is not `http`/`https` SHALL be invalid.", "scenarios": ["Page without Recipe data falls back to meta tags", "Unreachable page is a fallback", "Blocked page is a fallback", "Slow page times out", "Oversized page is a fallback", "Only http and https URLs are fetched"]}, {"id": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_import_flow", "label": "Import flow (recipe-import)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "Recipes \u2192 \"Add recipe\" (`/recipes/new`) SHALL offer a URL field with \"Import\" and a \"Start from scratch\" link. Import SHALL show \"Reading the page\u2026\" while the server works, then the recipe form prefilled with the draft (the editable preview, ingredient parses and the draft's tags shown; a tag name equal to an existing tag ignoring case uses that tag, others are created on Save); Save SHALL store i", "scenarios": ["Import shows an editable preview", "Imported tags reuse existing tags", "Import failure opens the prefilled manual form", "Invalid URL shows an inline error", "Known URL offers the existing recipe", "Known URL matches however the source was saved", "Image download failure saves without image", "Importing a real recipe URL"]}], "edges": [{"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec", "target": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec", "target": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_import_fallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec", "target": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_import_flow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec", "target": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_20_build_cooking_hub_proposal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "target": "src_lib_server_import_readrecipe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "target": "src_lib_server_import_extractrecipe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "target": "src_lib_server_import_parseduration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_read_a_recipe_from_a_page", "target": "src_lib_server_import_parseyield", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_import_spec_import_fallback", "target": "src_lib_server_import_readrecipe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/specs/recipe-import/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_specs_recipe_impor